/*
 * Explicit template solving for literal expressions(LiteralExpr).
 *
 * TemplateExplicitLiteralExprSolving handles template parameters whose
 * syntactic form is a literal expression. This includes:
 *
 *   - VarExpr referring to a template type variable,
 *   - constant literal expressions(integers, booleans, chars, etc.),
 *   - any literal that must be interpreted as a compile-time constant.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::template_::solve::explicit::literal
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/template_/solve/explicit/literal.yr
